    "又∠BCD=90°，",
    "∴∠MEN＝90°，",
    "∵点E是正方形ABCD对角线上的点，",
    "∴EM＝EN，",
    "∵∠DEF＝90°，",
    "∴∠DEN＝∠MEF＝90°﹣∠FEN，",
    "∵∠DNE＝∠FME＝90°，",
    "在△DEN和△FEM中，",
    "\\(\\begin{cases} \\angle DNE=\\angle FME \\\\ EN=EM \\\\ \\angle DEN=\\angle FEM \\end{cases}\\)，",
    "∴△DEN≌△FEM（ASA），",
    "∴EF＝DE，",
    "∵四边形DEFG是矩形，",
    "∴矩形DEFG是正方形；",
    "【小问2详解】",
    "①CE⊥CG，理由如下：",
    "∵正方形DEFG和正方形ABCD，",
    "∴DE＝DG，AD＝DC，",
    "∵∠CDG+∠CDE＝∠ADE+∠CDE＝90°，",
    "∴∠CDG＝∠ADE，",
    "在△ADE和△CDG中，",
    "\\(\\begin{cases} AD=CD \\\\ \\angle ADE=\\angle CDG \\\\ DE=DG \\end{cases}\\)，",
    "∴△ADE≌△CDG（SAS），",
    "∴∠DAE＝∠DCG，",
    "∵∠ACD+∠CAD+∠ADC＝180°，∠ADC＝90°，",
    "∴∠ACG＝∠ACD+∠DCG＝∠ACD+∠CAD＝90°，",
    "∴CE⊥CG；",
    "②由①知，△ADE≌△CDG，",
    "∴AE＝CG，",
    "∴CE+CG＝CE+AE＝AC＝\\(\\sqrt[] { 2 }\\)AB＝\\(\\sqrt[] { 2 }\\)×\\(\\sqrt[] { 2 }\\)＝2，",
    "故答案为：2."
